				</p>

				<h2 class="section-title">🎬 WHAT WE DO</h2>
				<div class="feature-grid">
					<div class="feature-item">🎥 MOVIE REVIEWS</div>
					<div class="feature-item">🔍 FILM BREAKDOWNS</div>
					<div class="feature-item">📰 CINEMA UPDATES</div>
					<div class="feature-item">🔥 HOT TAKES</div>
				</div>

